        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Heat, at local distribution cogen 160kWe Jakobsberg, allocation electricity</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Heat, at local distribution cogen 160kWe Jakobsberg, allocation electricity
Heat distibuted to end user over small local distribution network.;
UUID: 9e7b226e-33d7-3bb1-8866-c010fcdf16f0
The module includes heat from system cogen (i.e. the cogeneration unit, a heat pump and two oil boilers) and distribution.
Location: Efficiencies refer to a specific plant in Switzerland.
Technology: Specific cogeneration unit installed in Switzerland. Small new district heating according to (Frischknecht et al. 1996)
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Operator information 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9e7b226e-33d7-3bb1-8866-c010fcdf16f0.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
